error[L0248]: a `structural` clause needs one method that takes `(ref self)`
 --> expand/structural_clause_errors.knv:6:3
  |
6 |   (structural :struct "" :field "" :case "" :part "" :bare ""))
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this clause fills the body of one method
  |
  = help: declare one `(method name (fn ((ref self) ...) result))` in this `rust-trait`
  = note: run `knave doc L0248` for an explanation

